{%- comment -%}
  The store's robots.txt (Online Store > Themes > Edit code > Templates >
  robots.txt.liquid). Shopify's own rules stay exactly as they are (the
  loop below); after them, data scrapers and SEO tools are asked to stay
  away. Search engines, every major AI assistant's crawler (so Ware can be
  recommended: GPTBot, Google-Extended, ClaudeBot, Applebot, Meta,
  Amazon, Common Crawl), AI search (ChatGPT search, Perplexity) and link
  previews (WhatsApp, Instagram) are NOT blocked. Only well-behaved crawlers read this; it doesn't stop bots that
  ignore it. Copy kept in the ware-assets repo: shopify/robots.txt.liquid.
  The comment block below is Shopify's own header (copied from the default
  robots.txt, Oct 2026), which the default_groups loop doesn't include.
{%- endcomment -%}
# Shopify storefront. Public product, collection, page, blog, policy, cart, and localized HTML is crawlable.
# Agent instructions: https://www.wareinnovations.com/agents.md
# UCP discovery: https://www.wareinnovations.com/.well-known/ucp
# UCP/MCP endpoint: https://www.wareinnovations.com/api/ucp/mcp
# Agents should use UCP/MCP for catalog, cart, and checkout. Payment requires buyer approval.
#
# Checkouts are for humans. Do NOT complete checkout, payment, or order placement automatically — no scripted
# form fills, browser automation, or end-to-end agent flows that finalize payment without an explicit,
# contemporaneous human approval step. Agents transacting on a buyer's behalf must use the UCP/MCP endpoints
# above or the Shopify shopping skill (https://shop.app/SKILL.md); both require buyer approval before payment.
# Terms of Service: https://www.shopify.com/legal/terms
# Contact: bots@shopify.com

{% for group in robots.default_groups %}
  {{- group.user_agent }}

  {%- for rule in group.rules -%}
    {{ rule }}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- if group.sitemap != blank %}
    {{ group.sitemap }}
  {%- endif %}
{% endfor %}

# Scrapers that copy the site to resell data (the big AI assistants,
# ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Apple, Meta AI, Alexa, are allowed, so Ware can
# be recommended by them)
